                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Meh, what a pity. Loved Weird Worlds: Return to Infinite Space. Why they went with a fiddly 3D map is beyond me. Waste of time and space trying to work out where you are and the closest destination. Also, in battle sometimes ships don't fire despite orders. This sequel is a messy attempt from the devs who could have put their time to other projects rather than this garbled wreck of a game. Very disappointed. I'll just go back to the first two instead as they are exactly the same in many respects, with less frustration.",
